-- lib/sum-edit.cub — the paper's actual incremental edit of §10.2 (docs/hyperactivity.cub, “An actual incremental
-- edit”) as code: q(v) = foldl(+, 0, v) over a vector, the edit u_{i,x}(v) = v[i := x], the update
-- Δ_{i,x}(v, r) = r − v_i + x, its law λ_{i,x,v} : Δ_{i,x}(v, q(v)) = q(u_{i,x}(v)), and
-- maint_{i,x}(v, (r, e)) = (Δ_{i,x}(v, r), ap(Δ_{i,x}(v, −), e) · λ_{i,x,v}). The arithmetic is any
-- commutative group's — U₆₄ with +₆₄ and −₆₄ is one — and the law uses exactly associativity,
-- commutativity and (a + b) − b = a.
import "core.hypercubical"
import "maintenance.hypercubical"
